  "scope": "Frozen independent J501 footprint acceptance targets, not regenerated from the PCB or archive under test. GCT drawing plus previously reviewed 0.31mm NPTH copper/paste relief; 20 logical/physical pads, 16 connected copper lands, 12 stencil apertures.",
  "NPTH_clearance_rules": {
    "footprint_copper_and_paste_heel_design_mm": 0.31,
    "footprint_CAM_acceptance_mm": 0.3099,
    "other_routed_copper_all_layers_mm": 0.3,
    "basis": "Original j501-gct-fix-report.json distinguishes default_NPTH_rule_mm=.30 from J501_relief_design_minimum_mm=.31. Original fix_j501_gct.py constructs 0.325+.310mm circular heel relief; GCT nominal drawing does not require all-layer .31mm. Historical all-layer .3099 layout check was overbroad once planes are added. Project routing continues to obey the unchanged global .30mm rule, while physical footprint copper/paste retains exact .31mm relief."
  }
